        "jsCode": "// Collect all queue_ids from the skip branch into one array for a single bulk DB call.\nconst queue_ids = $input.all().map(item => item.json.queue_id).filter(id => id !== undefined && id !== null);\nreturn [{ json: { queue_ids } }];"
